{
    "title": "BlockPuz: Block Puzzle Games",
    "description": "It's time to train your brain! \"BlockPuz\" is a brain-teasing woody block puzzle game designed and updated continuously for true lovers of puzzle games!\r\n\r\nDrag different cube block pieces to appropriate positions to match the given patterns. Sounds simple? This block puzzle game has two wood block puzzle gameplay: \"BlockPuz\" and \"SudoCube\". The blocks cannot be rotated, and the difficulty of the block puzzle game increases step by step. There is only one solution for each wood block puzzle level. Are you ready for the puzzle games challenge?\r\n\r\n<b>BlockPuz:</b>\r\nDrag the cube block pieces at the bottom of the interface to find a suitable position in the given pattern to place the block pieces until the pattern is filled up correctly. Each jigsaw hd picture is a unique design, allowing you to get a unique wood block puzzle game experience. With thousands of wood block puzzle levels and exquisite patterns, welcome to the jigsaw world of fantastic brain teaser!\r\n\r\n<b>SudoCube:</b>\r\nDrag the given blocks and place it in the proper position on the block puzzle board. Drag the block puzzle pieces to the sudocube board, form any horizontal row, vertical row or nine square grids, so the puzzle blocks can be eliminated. The block puzzle game ends when there is no space to place new wooden blocks. Try to eliminate consecutively, get combo points to get higher scores, and strive to play longer in each round of block puzzle\uff01\r\n\r\n<b>Wood block puzzle game Features:</b>\r\n\u2605Classic block puzzle games for free with innovative jigsaw puzzle gameplay.\r\n\u2605Inject new jigsaw puzzle game elements on the basis of traditional block puzzle gameplay, experience the smoothness of classic gameplay elimination, bring a new exciting experience and have a picture puzzles brain test.\r\n\u2605Without any extra buttons, the cool puzzle games interface is extremely simple and refreshing, and the unique wooden style, which will definitely attract your eyes at first glance.\r\n\u2605The rules of block puzzle games for adults are simple and easy to master: the simple operation of dragging the squares, the rules are clear and easy to understand.\r\n\u2605No WIFI? No problem: \"BlockPuz\" is a stand-alone jigsaw puzzle game, no matter where you are, you can play a pleasant puzzle game without internet, bringing you puzzle fuzzle joy anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nA few minutes a day, easily improve your brain power! Download this brain teasers games and play our block puzzle games and compare with your friends whose score is higher!",
    "descriptionHTML": "It&#39;s time to train your brain! &quot;BlockPuz&quot; is a brain-teasing woody block puzzle game designed and updated continuously for true lovers of puzzle games!<br><br>Drag different cube block pieces to appropriate positions to match the given patterns. Sounds simple? This block puzzle game has two wood block puzzle gameplay: &quot;BlockPuz&quot; and &quot;SudoCube&quot;. The blocks cannot be rotated, and the difficulty of the block puzzle game increases step by step. There is only one solution for each wood block puzzle level. Are you ready for the puzzle games challenge?<br><br><b>BlockPuz:</b><br>Drag the cube block pieces at the bottom of the interface to find a suitable position in the given pattern to place the block pieces until the pattern is filled up correctly. Each jigsaw hd picture is a unique design, allowing you to get a unique wood block puzzle game experience. With thousands of wood block puzzle levels and exquisite patterns, welcome to the jigsaw world of fantastic brain teaser!<br><br><b>SudoCube:</b><br>Drag the given blocks and place it in the proper position on the block puzzle board. Drag the block puzzle pieces to the sudocube board, form any horizontal row, vertical row or nine square grids, so the puzzle blocks can be eliminated. The block puzzle game ends when there is no space to place new wooden blocks. Try to eliminate consecutively, get combo points to get higher scores, and strive to play longer in each round of block puzzle\uff01<br><br><b>Wood block puzzle game Features:</b><br>\u2605Classic block puzzle games for free with innovative jigsaw puzzle gameplay.<br>\u2605Inject new jigsaw puzzle game elements on the basis of traditional block puzzle gameplay, experience the smoothness of classic gameplay elimination, bring a new exciting experience and have a picture puzzles brain test.<br>\u2605Without any extra buttons, the cool puzzle games interface is extremely simple and refreshing, and the unique wooden style, which will definitely attract your eyes at first glance.<br>\u2605The rules of block puzzle games for adults are simple and easy to master: the simple operation of dragging the squares, the rules are clear and easy to understand.<br>\u2605No WIFI? No problem: &quot;BlockPuz&quot; is a stand-alone jigsaw puzzle game, no matter where you are, you can play a pleasant puzzle game without internet, bringing you puzzle fuzzle joy anytime, anywhere!<br><br>A few minutes a day, easily improve your brain power! Download this brain teasers games and play our block puzzle games and compare with your friends whose score is higher!",
